Title: THE ALGORITHM
Credit: Written by
Author: CineSpine Demo
Draft date: 2026-08-31

[Scene 1]
INT. SERVER ROOM - NIGHT

Blue LED lights blink rhythmically. ALICE (30s) types furiously on a terminal. BOB (40s) watches over her shoulder.

ALICE
We are running out of time. The discrepancies are compounding.

BOB
(panicked)
If the append-only spine fails, we lose the entire production state!

Alice slams the enter key.

ALICE
Got it. The Wrap Rescue Agent just mitigated the conflict.

[Scene 2]
EXT. MOUNTAIN TOP - DAY

A wide expanse of snowy peaks. A helicopter flies into frame.

BOB (V.O.)
We made it. 

The helicopter lands, blowing snow everywhere. 

[Scene 3]
INT. HELICOPTER - CONTINUOUS

Alice and Bob strap in. The PILOT looks back at them.

PILOT
Where to next?

ALICE
Back to base. We need to upload the checksums before the DIT logs freeze.

[Scene 4]
INT. COMMAND BASE - DAY

A massive tactical center. Screens everywhere displaying code and timecodes. The COMMANDER (50s) stands at the center table.

COMMANDER
They're late. If they don't sync by 0800, we're blind to the B-Camera footage.

Bob and Alice burst through the doors.

BOB
We have the logs!

[Scene 5]
EXT. BASE PERIMETER - NIGHT

Rain pours down. Guards patrol the fence line. A shadow slips past them... 

ALICE (V.O.)
But the algorithm was already inside.
